# project-backlog
IMPORT  backlog-item  FROM @main.templates

EXPORT TEMPLATE project-backlog:
  ABOUT   the final deliverable — every agreed improvement across all domains, ordered by impact
  TAGS    #agent-pack #analysis #scaffold #block
  APPLIES role:improvement-analyst — emitted when converge-project has walked every domain

  SLOTS:
    items: LIST <backlog-item> >=1  "one row per agreed improvement, highest impact first"
      MUST   list only findings the developer accepted — rejected and open notes stay in domain-decisions
      MUST   order the whole backlog by impact, not by domain
  BODY:
    improvement backlog:
    {items}
  EXAMPLE:
    improvement backlog:
    [high] parser/structure: centralise scattered parse helpers into one module
    [medium] objective/functionality: write the missing README quickstart
